{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>狂野港姐廖慧儀向來不吝嗇晒性感，早前她去峇里旅行，以火紅比堅尼上陣出海玩滑水，中門大開大晒Big爆身材，近日她再網晒新一系列的峇里照片，今次改到泳池打卡影靚相，雖然明顯比上次密實得多，以黑色小背心配綁帶泳褲，但迷你泳褲剪裁，令渾圓蜜桃臀表露無遺，相當養眼！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T08:00:04.780566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T07:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T13:37:59.695800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T07:57:40.957465+00:00","content_hash":"4ebc03d9a183f257b1c4bdbe00c54aad1c56baa9998de38ab5cf91ba3324756d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}